From 7c2fbd70456da1d48e5b14fc0310a86e1a9b3da2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lemonsh <lemon@lemonsh.moe>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:06:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/23] feat(ui): adapt host view, dashboard gauges, and topbar
 for remote hosts

Initialize remote host states via HostState::live_remote without /proc,
render remote CPU and RAM gauges in the dashboard host panel, hide
per-thread meters, frequency and temperatures on remote hosts, and allow
dynamic hostname updates in the live topbar chrome.
